  "human_auditable_considerations": {
    "accepted": [
      "Both n congruences are positive in the primary printed page and German ED0015.",
      "The proof needs n in p: together with b in p this gives bn in p^2, contradicting mc not in p^2 because bn=mc.",
      "A local successor producer plus synchronized assembled Unit122 preserves custody and replayability."
    ],
    "rejected": [
      "Retain either inherited negative n reading, because it conflicts with both authorities and breaks the stated contradiction.",
      "Repair only the assembled base, because that would leave the active producer and assembled body inconsistent.",
      "Modify the central producer origin, because it is immutable adverse lineage.",
      "Change neighboring m, m^2, c, mc, or b congruences, or modernize prose or notation, because those readings are protected and outside scope."
    ],
    "claim_boundary": "Project-authority mathematical-sign fidelity only; no native-language validation, community certification, critical-edition claim, build, publication, or DOI effect."
